    "_comment": "Tell jsx-a11y which library components render which DOM element, so it can check them. Only components that pass props straight to that element belong here: react-bootstrap Dropdown.Item, Nav.Link and Navbar.Brand render an Anchor that adds role=button and keyboard handling itself, so mapping them to <a> would produce false positives.",
